  126: TranslatedQuestion(question: "To prepare 1 L of 1 M NaCl solution you need:", options: ["1 mol of NaCl", "1 g of NaCl", "58.5 L of NaCl", "1 L of NaCl"], explanation: "1 M × 1 L = 1 mol of solute (58.5 g of NaCl)."),
